<title>USA: Stolt Comex trims Q4 shr loss.</title>
<headline>Stolt Comex trims Q4 shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.26     loss	 $0.44</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,559     loss	 4,380</p>
<p> Net oper rev	   101,556		   77,806</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,000		   10,000</p>
<p>			  Year</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.49     loss	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net loss		  14,902     loss	 2,014</p>
<p> Net oper revs	  313,358		  327,042</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,000		   10,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company based in Aberdeen, Scotland. Results released in New York.</p>
<p>Period ended November 30.</p>
<p>Loss for the quarter includes a $2.2 million loss on the disposal of Sogetram, a French subsidiary.  Net loss for 12-month period ending Nov. 30, 1996 also includes the cost of disposal of Sogetram.</p>
<p>Stolt Comex Seaway.</p>
